<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ferrari LaFerrari | The Ultimate Hybrid Hypercar</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syncopate:wght@400;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --red: #ff1801;
            --bg: #050505;
            --surface: rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.85);
            --border: rgba(255, 24, 1, 0.3);
            --text: #ededed;
            --muted: #999999;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        .cinematic-bg {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            z-index: -2;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0101 0%, #050505 50%, #120202 100%);
        }

        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 25px 60px;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .brand {
            font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .brand span {
            color: var(--red);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        header.hero {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        header.hero h5 {
            font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            color: var(--red);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        header.hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 8rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #fff;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 100px 25px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        section {
            margin-bottom: 140px;
        }

        h2.title {
            font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--red);
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .img-card {
            width: 100%;
            height: 450px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .img-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        .grid-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .stat-box {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }

        .stat-box h3 {
            font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            color: var(--red);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .split {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .img-card { height: 280px; }
        }

        .split-text p {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .specs-table {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .spec-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 22px 28px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .spec-label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .spec-val { color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; }

        .creators-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 24, 1, 0.08) 0%, rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.9) 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 80px;
        }

        .creators-section h3 {
            font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            color: var(--red);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .creators-section h2 {
            font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .founders-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .founder-card {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 25px 20px;
        }

        .founder-card h4 {
            font-family: 'Syncopate', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .founder-card p {
            color: var(--red);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px;
            background: rgba(2, 2, 2, 0.95);
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="cinematic-bg"></div>

    <nav>
        <div class="brand">FERRARI <span>LAFERRARI</span></div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li>
            <li><a href="#performance">Performance</a></li>
            <li><a href="#powertrain">Powertrain</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
        <h5>The Pinnacle of Maranello</h5>
        <h1>LAFERRARI</h1>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="overview">
            <h2 class="title">The Masterpiece</h2>
            <div class="img-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617814076367-b759c7d7e738?q=80&w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Ferrari LaFerrari Overview">
            </div>
            <div class="split">
                <div class="split-text">
                    <p>The LaFerrari represents the absolute height of Ferrari's technological prowess. Code-named F150, it merges naturally aspirated V12 performance with Formula 1-derived hybrid electrification (HY-KERS).</p>
                </div>
                <div class="specs-table">
                    <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Production Years</span><span class="spec-val">2013 – 2018</span></div>
                    <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Chassis</span><span class="spec-val">T800 Carbon Fiber</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="performance">
            <h2 class="title">Core Metrics</h2>
            <div class="grid-stats">
                <div class="stat-box"><h3>950 HP</h3><p>Combined Output</p></div>
                <div class="stat-box"><h3>2.4s</h3><p>0–60 MPH</p></div>
                <div class="stat-box"><h3>217+</h3><p>Top Speed (MPH)</p></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="powertrain">
            <h2 class="title">HY-KERS Powertrain</h2>
            <div class="img-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583121274602-3e2820c69888?q=80&w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Ferrari LaFerrari Powertrain">
            </div>
            <div class="split">
                <div class="specs-table">
                    <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Engine Layout</span><span class="spec-val">65° V12</span></div>
                    <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Electric Motor</span><span class="spec-val">163 PS</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="split-text">
                    <p>The electric motor is integrated directly into the dual-clutch transmission to eliminate low-end torque gaps and offer instant throttle response.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="creators-section">
            <h3>Visionary Architects</h3>
            <h2>Created & Engineered By</h2>
            <div class="founders-grid">
                <div class="founder-card"><h4>Enrique Tirkey</h4><p>Co-Founder</p></div>
                <div class="founder-card"><h4>Debdwij Sarkar</h4><p>Co-Founder</p></div>
                <div class="founder-card"><h4>Saket Roy</h4><p>Co-Founder</p></div>
                <div class="founder-card"><h4>Samrat Mukherjee</h4><p>Co-Founder</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 FERRARI LAFERRARI &bull; ALL RIGHTS RESERVED</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
